["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"cn\"\n data-hay=\"Korean Murder Cases Reversed: Public Opinion Turns Incidents into Political Labels The Chinese student case flipped from &quot;Koreans killing Chinese&quot; to a Korean-Chinese suspect; the police officer who took the report in the Jeju four-body case allegedly fabricated the closure. What truly warrants vigilance is not public safety, but how public opinion turns individual cases into political labels. 东亚观察局 东亚观察局 297 东观变身罪案播客：从两起命案看韩国社会是否还安全 Korea Public Safety Crime China-Korea Relations Public Opinion NPD / Narcissistic Personality Disorder one room territorial jurisdiction\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-27-eastasia-两起案件照出中韩舆论同一种政治想象/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPm9Kh9XglTbg7Fl9vCW0mRg-Py.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"cn\"><span class=\"src\" lang=\"zh\">东亚观察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Korean Murder Cases Reversed: Public Opinion Turns Incidents into Political Labels</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">The Chinese student case flipped from &quot;Koreans killing Chinese&quot; to a Korean-Chinese suspect; the police officer who took the report in the Jeju four-body case allegedly fabricated the closure. What truly warrants vigilance is not public safety, but how public opinion turns individual cases into political labels.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Korea</span><span class=\"tag\">Public Safety</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\"\n data-hay=\"The crust was stretched thin and should have subsided, yet the American West rose a mile Evidence of plate stretching is usually buried by sediment, but the Basin and Range Province in the US is a rare exception: the crust has been stretched to about twice its original width and is still extending, and GPS, paleoseismic records, and detachment faults let us see it. Geology Bites Geology Bites Brian Wernicke on Lithospheric Extension and the Basin and Range Province structural geology Basin and Range lithospheric extension detachment faults GPS crustal deformation Basin and Range Province lithospheric extension low-angle detachment faults dismembered thrust sheets\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-27-geologybites-地壳拉伸应沉陷-盆岭省却仍高一英里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://d3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net/staging/podcast_uploaded_episode/1251669/1251669-1787864599777-55cade44ca8de.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>The crust was stretched thin and should have subsided, yet the American West rose a mile</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Evidence of plate stretching is usually buried by sediment, but the Basin and Range Province in the US is a rare exception: the crust has been stretched to about twice its original width and is still extending, and GPS, paleoseismic records, and detachment faults let us see it.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">structural geology</span><span class=\"tag\">Basin and Range</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\"\n data-hay=\"Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement: Buying Industry-Wide Default Limits The settlement amount is only the surface: what&#x27;s really valuable is the two-hour time lock, nighttime ban, and age assurance becoming default settings, plus the $18B-vs-$12B gap that pressures TikTok and YouTube to join. The Journal The Journal Will Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement Change Social Media? Meta TikTok minor protection regulatory settlement default settings age assurance COPPA age assurance algorithmic recommendations\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-27-wsjournal-meta-180亿和解-买的是行业默认限制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/b84f9932-8174-11e9-bbd8-7f261513f0c9/image/d84a4f4d55158df9d14f6f2d4b219a28.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=400&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement: Buying Industry-Wide Default Limits</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">The settlement amount is only the surface: what&#x27;s really valuable is the two-hour time lock, nighttime ban, and age assurance becoming default settings, plus the $18B-vs-$12B gap that pressures TikTok and YouTube to join.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"Before AI Spirals Out of Control, Plan A Is the Only Brake That Can Still Be Applied in Time Plan A uses &quot;research transparency + compute limits + citizen dividends&quot; to pull AI back from exponential explosion to a controllable slope; its author still rates it at a 15% catastrophe probability, but it beats sitting back and waiting for AI takeoff. 80,000 Hours Podcast 80,000 Hours AI 2027&#x27;s author returns with a plan to change the ending | Daniel Kokotajlo AI governance superintelligence AGI timeline Plan A alignment compute control Plan A horizon-length neuralese superpersuasion privacy-preserving auditing mutual assured compute destruction\" href